<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0"><channel><title>Notify NYC CAP RSS Feed</title><link>https://feeds.everbridge.net/feeds/453003085617722/rss/rss.xml</link><description>Common Alerting Protocol formatted RSS feed</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:48:55 GMT</pubDate><lastBuildDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:48:55 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>Everbridge: www.everbridge.com</generator><item><title>Notify NYC -FDNY (פייערלעשער) אקטיוויטעט</title><description>וועגן טואונגען מצד די ניו־יארקער פייערלעשער, קען מען דערווארטן אפהאלטן אין פארקער ווי אויך די אנוועזנהייט פון נויט־פערסאנאל אין דער געגנט פון West 31st Street קארנער 8th Avenue אין Manhattan. קלערט וועגן אלטערנאטיווע וועגן און לאזט איבעריגע צייט אנצוקומען.</description><guid>2833202557392536</guid><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:48:50 GMT</pubDate><category>Safety</category><author>NYCEM [Yiddish]</author><enclosure length="1686" type="application/xml" url="https://feeds.everbridge.net/feeds/453003085617722/cap/6afba472988a087b02366630.xml"/><link>https://feeds.everbridge.net/feeds/453003085617722/cap/6afba472988a087b02366630.xml</link></item><item><title>Notify NYC ۔۔ FDNY کی  سرگرمی</title><description>FDNY کی سرگرمی کے باعث، Manhattan میں West 31st Street اور 8th Avenue کے علاقے میں ٹریفک میں تاخیر اور بڑی تعداد میں ہنگامی عملے کی موجودگی کی توقع رکھیں۔ متبادل راستے اختیار کریں اور سفر کے لیے اضافی وقت رکھیں۔</description><guid>2833202557392535</guid><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:48:50 GMT</pubDate><category>Safety</category><author>NYCEM [Urdu]</author><enclosure length="1569" type="application/xml" url="https://feeds.everbridge.net/feeds/453003085617722/cap/6afba472d19a37bb5c7307a4.xml"/><link>https://feeds.everbridge.net/feeds/453003085617722/cap/6afba472d19a37bb5c7307a4.xml</link></item><item><title>Notify NYC - Actividad del FDNY</title><description>Debido a la actividad del FDNY, habrá demoras por el tráfico y gran presencia de personal de emergencia en el área de West 31st Street y 8th Avenue en Manhattan. Considere usar rutas alternativas y tenga en cuenta que tendrá más tiempo de viaje.</description><guid>2833202557392534</guid><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:48:50 GMT</pubDate><category>Safety</category><author>NYCEM [Spanish]</author><enclosure length="1468" type="application/xml" url="https://feeds.everbridge.net/feeds/453003085617722/cap/6afba472d19a37bb5c7307a5.xml"/><link>https://feeds.everbridge.net/feeds/453003085617722/cap/6afba472d19a37bb5c7307a5.xml</link></item><item><title>Notify NYC - Мероприятия пожарной охраны</title><description>В связи с мероприятиями Пожарного департамента Нью-Йорка возможны задержки транспорта и присутствие большого количества сотрудников аварийных служб в районе West 31st Street и 8th Avenue в Manhattan. Выбирайте маршруты объезда и выделяйте дополнительное время на поездку.</description><guid>2833202557392533</guid><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:48:50 GMT</pubDate><category>Safety</category><author>NYCEM [Russian]</author><enclosure length="1726" type="application/xml" url="https://feeds.everbridge.net/feeds/453003085617722/cap/6afba472988a087b02366631.xml"/><link>https://feeds.everbridge.net/feeds/453003085617722/cap/6afba472988a087b02366631.xml</link></item><item><title>Notify NYC - Działania FDNY</title><description>Z powodu akcji straży pożarnej (FDNY) należy oczekiwać spowolnienia ruchu  i  obecności licznego personelu ratowniczego na terenie West 31st Street i 8th Avenue w Manhattan. Rozważ przejazd inną trasą i pamiętaj, że dojazd do celu może ci zająć więcej czasu.</description><guid>2833202557392532</guid><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:48:50 GMT</pubDate><category>Safety</category><author>NYCEM [Polish]</author><enclosure length="1486" type="application/xml" url="https://feeds.everbridge.net/feeds/453003085617722/cap/6afba472988a087b0236662f.xml"/><link>https://feeds.everbridge.net/feeds/453003085617722/cap/6afba472988a087b0236662f.xml</link></item><item><title>Notify NYC -FDNY 임무수행</title><description>FDNY(뉴욕 소방국) 임무수행으로 인해, Manhattan의 West 31st Street 및 8th Avenue 지역에서 교통체증 및 다수의 응급 요원이 배칠될 것으로 예상됩니다. 대체 구간 이용을 고려하고 도착지까지 추가 시간을 예상하십시오.</description><guid>2833202557392531</guid><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:48:50 GMT</pubDate><category>Safety</category><author>NYCEM [Korean]</author><enclosure length="1493" type="application/xml" url="https://feeds.everbridge.net/feeds/453003085617722/cap/6afba472fad59296140b9e36.xml"/><link>https://feeds.everbridge.net/feeds/453003085617722/cap/6afba472fad59296140b9e36.xml</link></item><item><title>Notify NYC - Attività FDNY</title><description>A causa di attività di FDNY, si prevedono rallentamenti della circolazione  e la presenza di un alto numero di personale di emergenza nella zona West 31st Street e 8th Avenue in Manhattan. Si consiglia di utilizzare tragitti alternativi e di prevedere un tempo di spostamento superiore al normale.</description><guid>2833202557392530</guid><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:48:50 GMT</pubDate><category>Safety</category><author>NYCEM [Italian]</author><enclosure length="1512" type="application/xml" url="https://feeds.everbridge.net/feeds/453003085617722/cap/6afba472fad59296140b9e37.xml"/><link>https://feeds.everbridge.net/feeds/453003085617722/cap/6afba472fad59296140b9e37.xml</link></item><item><title>Notify NYC - Aktivite FDNY</title><description>Akòz aktivite FDNY, atann pou gen reta nan trafik ak yon gwo prezans pèsonèl ijans nan zòn West 31st Street ak 8th Avenue nan Manhattan. Anvizaje itilize lòt wout epi mete plis tan pou vwayaje.</description><guid>2833202557392529</guid><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:48:45 GMT</pubDate><category>Safety</category><author>NYCEM [Haitian Creole]</author><enclosure length="1418" type="application/xml" url="https://feeds.everbridge.net/feeds/453003085617722/cap/6afba46d988a087b0236662b.xml"/><link>https://feeds.everbridge.net/feeds/453003085617722/cap/6afba46d988a087b0236662b.xml</link></item><item><title>Notify NYC - Activité FDNY</title><description>En raison d’activités du FDNY, s’attendre à des ralentissements et à une présence importante de personnel de secours dans votre zone. Envisagez d'autres itinéraires ainsi qu’un temps de trajet plus long.</description><guid>2833202557392528</guid><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:48:45 GMT</pubDate><category>Safety</category><author>NYCEM [French]</author><enclosure length="1427" type="application/xml" url="https://feeds.everbridge.net/feeds/453003085617722/cap/6afba46dd19a37bb5c7307a0.xml"/><link>https://feeds.everbridge.net/feeds/453003085617722/cap/6afba46dd19a37bb5c7307a0.xml</link></item><item><title>Notify NYC - 紐約消防局活動</title><description>由於紐約消防局活動，預計Manhattan 的 West 31st Street 和 8th Avenue區域可能會出現交通延誤和出現大量緊急救援人員的情況。考慮其他路線或提前上路。</description><guid>2833202557392527</guid><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:48:45 GMT</pubDate><category>Safety</category><author>NYCEM [Chinese]</author><enclosure length="1416" type="application/xml" url="https://feeds.everbridge.net/feeds/453003085617722/cap/6afba46dfad59296140b9e2f.xml"/><link>https://feeds.everbridge.net/feeds/453003085617722/cap/6afba46dfad59296140b9e2f.xml</link></item><item><title>Notify NYC - FDNY-এর কার্যক্রম</title><description>FDNY-এর কার্যক্রমের কারণে, Manhattan-এ West 31st Street ও 8th Avenue-এর এলাকায় যানবাহন চলাচলে বিলম্ব হতে পারে এবং জরুরি কাজে নিয়োজিত লোকজনের উপস্থিতি অনেক বেশি থাকতে পারে। বিকল্প পথগুলো বিবেচনা করুন এবং ভ্রমণের জন্য বাড়তি সময় হাতে রাখুন।</description><guid>2833202557392526</guid><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:48:45 GMT</pubDate><category>Safety</category><author>NYCEM [Bengali]</author><enclosure length="1798" type="application/xml" url="https://feeds.everbridge.net/feeds/453003085617722/cap/6afba46dfad59296140b9e31.xml"/><link>https://feeds.everbridge.net/feeds/453003085617722/cap/6afba46dfad59296140b9e31.xml</link></item><item><title>Notify NYC - نشاط إدارة الإطفاء في مدينة نيويورك</title><description>نظراً لنشاط إدارة الإطفاء في مدينة نيويورك، توقّع حدوث تأخير في حركة السير ووجود مكثف لموظفي الطوارئ في West 31st Street و  8th Avenue  في Manhattan. يجب مراعاة استخدام الطرق البديلة وإتاحة مزيد من الوقت للسفر.</description><guid>2833202557392525</guid><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:48:45 GMT</pubDate><category>Safety</category><author>NYCEM [Arabic]</author><enclosure length="1613" type="application/xml" url="https://feeds.everbridge.net/feeds/453003085617722/cap/6afba46dd19a37bb5c7307a1.xml"/><link>https://feeds.everbridge.net/feeds/453003085617722/cap/6afba46dd19a37bb5c7307a1.xml</link></item><item><title>Notify NYC - FDNY Activity - West 31st Street &amp; 8th Avenue (MN)</title><description>Notification issued 11-16-2026 at 07:47 PM.

Due to FDNY activity, expect traffic delays and a heavy presence of emergency personnel in the area of West 31st Street and 8th Avenue in Manhattan. Consider alternate routes and allow for additional travel time.</description><guid>2837016488342398</guid><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:48:00 GMT</pubDate><category>Fire</category><author>NYCEM [English]</author><enclosure length="1510" type="application/xml" url="https://feeds.everbridge.net/feeds/453003085617722/cap/6afba440988a087b02366629.xml"/><link>https://feeds.everbridge.net/feeds/453003085617722/cap/6afba440988a087b02366629.xml</link></item></channel></rss>